      "text": "---\n\n# 🟩 **Testing MongoDB with Mocha**\n\nUse **before()** and **after()** to connect/disconnect DB.\n\n```js\nbefore(async () => {\n  await mongoose.connect(\"mongodb://localhost/testdb\");\n});\n\nafter(async () => {\n  await mongoose.connection.close();\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📝 **Useful Mocha CLI Commands**\n\nRun all tests inside `test` folder:\n\n```\nnpx mocha\n```\n\nRun a specific test file:\n\n```\nnpx mocha test/user.test.js\n```\n\nRun tests with watch mode:\n\n```\nnpx mocha --watch\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 **Quick Summary for Revision**\n\n### **Mocha**\n\n* Test runner\n* describe() & it()\n* Hooks: before, beforeEach, after, afterEach\n* Handles async with async/await\n\n### **Chai**\n\n* Assertion library\n* expect() syntax is most readable\n* deep.equal for objects\n* chai-http for Express API tests\n\n### **MERN Usage**\n\n* Test API routes\n* Test controllers\n* Test DB logic\n* Test utils",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "---\n\n# 🟩 **Testing MongoDB with Mocha**\n\nUse **before()** and **after()** to connect/disconnect DB.\n\n```js\nbefore(async () => {\n  await mongoose.connect(\"mongodb://localhost/testdb\");\n});\n\nafter(async () => {\n  await mongoose.connection.close();\n});\n```\n\n---\n\n# 📝 **Useful Mocha CLI Commands**\n\nRun all tests inside `test` folder:\n\n```\nnpx mocha\n```\n\nRun a specific test file:\n\n```\nnpx mocha test/user.test.js\n```\n\nRun tests with watch mode:\n\n```\nnpx mocha --watch\n```\n\n---\n\n# 🎯 **Quick Summary for Revision**\n\n### **Mocha**\n\n* Test runner\n* describe() & it()\n* Hooks: before, beforeEach, after, afterEach\n* Handles async with async/await\n\n### **Chai**\n\n* Assertion library\n* expect() syntax is most readable\n* deep.equal for objects\n* chai-http for Express API tests\n\n### **MERN Usage**\n\n* Test API routes\n* Test controllers\n* Test DB logic\n* Test utils",
