      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"mocha \\\"tests/**/*.test.js\\\"\"\n  }\n\nThis is a glob pattern (a file-matching pattern).\n\nIt tells Mocha:\n\n“Find all .test.js files inside the tests folder and any subfolders, and run them.”\n\nLet’s break the pattern:\n\n🔹 tests/\n\nStart looking inside the tests folder.\n\n🔹 **/\n\nGo through all subfolders, no matter how deep.\n\n🔹 *.test.js\n\nPick files whose names end with:\n\n.test.js",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"mocha \\\"tests/**/*.test.js\\\"\"\n  }\n\nThis is a glob pattern (a file-matching pattern).\n\nIt tells Mocha:\n\n“Find all .test.js files inside the tests folder and any subfolders, and run them.”\n\nLet’s break the pattern:\n\n🔹 tests/\n\nStart looking inside the tests folder.\n\n🔹 **/\n\nGo through all subfolders, no matter how deep.\n\n🔹 *.test.js\n\nPick files whose names end with:\n\n.test.js",
